---

NOTE ON GAME CONTENT

This repository contains only original source code and documentation. It contains no
game data and grants no rights to any.

PS2RC is provided for interoperability, preservation and homebrew use with a copy of a
game that you legally own. It ships no game code or assets: it works only on a disc
image that the user supplies, on the user's own machine. All trademarks and copyrighted
game content remain the property of their respective owners.

Rightsholders with concerns are welcome to contact the maintainer before filing a
formal notice: through the repository's issue tracker, the community server
(https://discord.gg/wV8x46ZTDu), or by e-mail to sandstonedevpsp@gmail.com.

---

CHANGES FROM VERSION 1.0

Version 1.1 changes only wording, not what the licence requires: the term defined in
section 0 is now "Listed Disc" and its notice is named DISTRIBUTION.md; condition 2(e)
now names SandstoneDev's written permission (which SandstoneDev could always give) and
states that it is not a claim of any right in any game. A notice published under
version 1.0 still counts. Copies of PS2RC and of Derived Works that were Distributed
under version 1.0 remain under version 1.0; this version applies to copies Distributed
with it.
